          "value": "<p>This non-sentient Replicator cannot be manipulated with Charisma based skills like Deception, Intimidate, or Persuasion. Swarm: A Replicator Swarm can occupy another creature's space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a tiny creature. Acid Spray: At the end of its turn all enemies in the same space as the swarm suffer 21 (6d6) acid damage.</p>"
